 "_doc": "Two ordered passes, first match wins in each: (1) the literal path against every rule, so a rule naming a _test.go file explicitly always wins; (2) for test files, the source-file name (foo_test.go -> foo.go), so tests follow their source by default. A path ending in '/' is a directory-prefix match; otherwise the directory must match exactly and the basename is a glob. norank:true keeps a feature out of rankings and headline totals while still measuring it.",
